# VOX's four sounds, black keys 8-11 (GLASS, REED, HALO, LOW): a key picks one, mid-phrase too; held,
# the knobs shape it (BRIGHT, WAVE, FILTER, RELEASE) and only it. SHAPE's VOX pages are the sound
# playing: VOX 2 (WAVE, FILTER, RESO, GLIDE), VOX 3 (DETUNE, B OCT, B MIX, ENV). Each plays, no clicks,
# no clips. Audio in vsounds.wav.
autoplay 0
wait 300
wav vsounds.wav
expect vcur 1
key w4 down
wait 1500
tapkey b8
wait 100
expect vcur 2
wait 1500
key w4 up
wait 2000
key b9 down
wait 100
turn K2 10
turn K3 -6
wait 100
shot vsound_hold.png
key b9 up
expect vcur 3
expect vs3.6 44
expect vs3.7 0
expect vs2.6 96
tapkey w2
wait 1500
tapkey b10
wait 100
expect vcur 4
tapkey w0
wait 300
tapkey w4
wait 2500
tap ENV
turn SELECT 2
wait 100
turn K4 -10
expect vs4.9 24
turn SELECT 1
wait 100
turn K2 -1
expect vs4.11 0
turn K2 3
expect vs4.11 2
shot vox3.png
tapkey b7
wait 100
expect vcur 1
tapkey w4
wait 12000
wavstop
expect clips 0
